$ ranges --help
usage: ranges  [--cfl value] [--threads value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version]


Optional switches:
   --cfl value
    range (0, 1]
    default value 0.8
    CFL number
   --threads value
    range [1, 256]
    default value 1
    OpenMP threads
   --help, -h
    Print this help message
   --markdown, -md
    Save this help message in a Markdown file
   --version, -v
    Print version
